stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Absent
  Absent --> Ready: approved create + baseline verify
  Ready --> Ready: predefined observation
  Ready --> Stopped: stop condition
  Ready --> Resetting: approved reset
  Stopped --> Resetting: approved reset
  Resetting --> Ready: baseline digest matches
  Ready --> Destroying: approved destroy
  Stopped --> Destroying: approved destroy
  Destroying --> Destroyed: state root absent + attestation
  Destroyed --> [*]
